Funding-Text = {This paper is based on our ongoing research project at the University of
   Copenhagen (DK) on place-based and project-oriented strategic planning
   in peripheral rural areas. The reported case study was partly financed
   by the charitable trust Realdania which also financed ``Land of
   Opportunities{''}. However, the authors have had full academic freedom
   in their research. One of the authors was a member of the formal
   advisory board for the duration of the ``Land of opportunities{''}
