   Williams, E.; Vickery, H. M., Harper Adams Univ, Anim Behav \& Welf Res Grp, Newport TF10 8NB, England.
   Stratford, L., Univ Chester, Div Psychol, Chester CH1 4BJ, England.
   Johansen, F. P., Teagasc Moorepark, Anim \& Grasslands Innovat Ctr, Pig \& Poultry Dev Dept, Fermoy P61 C996, Ireland.},
